# Gitleaks ignore patterns
# Patterns that should be ignored during secret scanning

# Example: Ignore specific test files with fake credentials
# **/test/**/*.env
# **/__tests__/**/*.env

# Ignore example files
**/env.example
**/.env.example

# Ignore documentation files with example credentials
**/*.md
**/README.md

# Ignore backup files
**/*.backup
**/*.bak

